        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6b41b4b8-ca0b-479a-9d4d-ea8b28df00da\",\"review_text\":\"In some songs it shows like \\\"couldn't load lyrics for this song\\\" please fix these issue (Thank you for seeing this issue I hope you'll fix it soon)\"},{\"review_id\":\"e362199c-7333-4243-83d9-f73bf1e11624\",\"review_text\":\"Bad\"},{\"review_id\":\"df8b636f-0fab-4835-9fac-a5ae6cfd5c2d\",\"review_text\":\"Not sure what's going on, music is cutting in and out and just not playing correctly also it downloads at random not sure if it's just adding titles or if it's just something else\"},{\"review_id\":\"5b6aa177-e9f1-4b1d-aa10-1b037d2256f9\",\"review_text\":\"Ok 👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"de044200-f9e8-4743-a1b8-c25e6fac48a0\",\"review_text\":\"I have been using Spotify for a long time and previously gave it a 5 star review, but something has happened in the app, maybe an update I wasn't aware of and now I can't filter my Liked Songs playlist by genre. It keeps giving me zero results no matter which I pick and says that I have filters set that may hide some results. I've check repeatedly and there is no filter to explain this. I'd appreciate a response from Spotify to help me solve this problem.\"},{\"review_id\":\"71e291e6-e778-4fe8-8156-6d933aad72bc\",\"review_text\":\"Sobf\"},{\"review_id\":\"a14bdadf-94db-453d-96a7-180d22562f53\",\"review_text\":\"Really good and my son really enjoys the experience and everything ☺️\"},{\"review_id\":\"54fe9398-6b25-4d7e-9262-9275dcdbc3df\",\"review_text\":\"The app is good but y'all even removed the function of repeat play.....literally the important one....now one needs to buy premium for that?...i guess ads were enough...disappointed.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a04bde29-2d42-489a-8c89-a45b35c1dfb8\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome i like its aap\"},{\"review_id\":\"2c1b2db1-37a3-4390-91a8-9925989dd6ef\",\"review_text\":\"I can always find my music the one that helps me relax I just love Spotify♥️\"}]}"
